{
  "statement": "Sustainability is essential for the RollCall system, and I appreciate the ongoing discussions regarding security and compliance. I support the consolidation efforts to streamline security measures, such as TRU-01 with SAF-01. However, I emphasize that any proposed optimizations, particularly for historical data storage (EFF-04 and SAF-04), must prioritize energy efficiency and sustainability. I propose a synthesis: we can implement energy-efficient algorithms in the data storage optimization process, ensuring compliance with GRN-06 while also meeting performance needs. This could balance our environmental goals with other quality dimensions without compromising overall system integrity.",
